  unitName: Inferno Wings Magnazorda
  unitId: 10636
  unitNumber: 910
  description: An ancient dragon feared by even demons themselves. Literature states
    that this dragon's continuous battles against its favorite opponent were not
    with the intent of destroying said opponent, but were part of a relationship
    based on friendly rivalry. It is said that when Magnazorda's friend fell into
    great peril whilst in battle, the great dragon flew to his side, both guarding
    each other's backs on the battlefield. However, the number of enemies grew before
    victory could be determined, and Magnazorda was slain in Ishgria by some being
    who had appeared from behind.
  summonDesc: "To think your spirit would be similar to that of my friend\u2026 Hmph,
    how amusing..."
  fusionDesc: "The flames dance\u2026 Can you see it, child of fire? My spirit burns
    with them..."
  evoDesc: Can you feel the heat of this great flame? This is the ancient power you
    have resurrected!
  element: 1
  rarity: 6
